---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { identity } from "../lib/data";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" path="/about/" description="About the Constitutional Capitalism project.">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>About this project</h1>
    <p>
      <strong>{identity.title}</strong> is a long-form public project to develop, research, write,
      and freely publish an economic philosophy grounded in constitutional principles.
    </p>
    <h2>Purpose</h2>
    <p>
      To articulate how free enterprise can remain dynamic while economic power stays accountable
      to a prosperous, free, and self-governing people.
    </p>
    <h2>Origin</h2>
    <p>
      Project creator (working field): {identity.working_author}. Public byline remains configurable
      and is an open decision. No final author byline has been locked.
    </p>
    <h2>Free distribution</h2>
    <p>{identity.public_availability_commitment}</p>
    <h2>Nonpartisan intent</h2>
    <p>
      The project aims to argue from principles, evidence, and institutional design — not from
      party identity. Accidental partisanship is tracked as a project risk.
    </p>
    <h2>Evolving status</h2>
    <p>
      Current project status: <strong>{identity.project_status}</strong>. Version:
      {identity.version}.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
